// Return to a chat: where you left it, the row you were reading at the
// same place on screen (review table row 3; decided 1; rule 8: the model
// keeps each chat's anchor). Fails today: nothing is restored.
// check: return land=anchor
{"width": 1180}
{"select": "{{chat}}"}
{"wait": 2}
{"scroll": 900}
{"wait": 1}
{"probe": "return", "for": 5}
{"select": "{{other}}"}
{"wait": 1.5}
{"select": "{{chat}}"}
{"wait": 2}
